&CONTROL
  calculation = 'relax'
  prefix = 'ti'
  outdir = './tmp'
  pseudo_dir = '../' ! your directory
  nstep = 250
/

&SYSTEM
  ibrav = 4
  a = 4.56737
  c = 2.82624
  nat = 3
  ntyp = 1
  ecutwfc = 60
  ecutrho = 480
  occupations = 'smearing'
  smearing = 'mv'
  degauss = 0.02
/

&ELECTRONS
  conv_thr = 1.0d-8
/

&IONS
/

ATOMIC_SPECIES
  Ti 47.867 Ti.pbe-spn-kjpaw_psl.1.0.0.UPF

ATOMIC_POSITIONS angstrom
Ti   0.00000   0.00000   0.00000
Ti  -0.00000   2.63698   1.41312
Ti   2.28369   1.31849   1.41312

K_POINTS automatic
 12 12 12 0 0 0
